{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"22821","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:22821","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_21116","characterName":"爱宕号巡洋舰","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21116","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"爱宕号巡洋舰","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"203.76"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"6.11"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"19"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"高雄型の2番艦、愛宕よ、うふふ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"呉海軍工廠で生まれたの。バランスがとれた重武装ボディでしょ？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"レイテ沖の決戦では、第一遊撃部隊の旗艦として出撃したんだけど……ま、そんなこともあるわよね。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21116"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd6c7037cadf4ddf69c5e232e7665070582493f4799957e96d6915cf82004707.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a28867dd57c77a50adbc41f51359f8357b29c098ac7ee375a90f57b797c4591.webp","width":144,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"東山奈央","creatorId":"vndb:s5716","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5716","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5716","name":"東山 奈央","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:21116:6010:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_21560","characterName":"罗盘妖精","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21560","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"罗盘妖精","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"指引玩家舰队进军方向的妖精，目前已知数量为四只。出现原因不明，正体不明，为什么能引导舰队不明：是谜一样的存在。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21560"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6bab2586ae4f25421cff49e26e8434867686c0705bbc70c5ef979b2e351af8b1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b215f31e3d9a930c3c7eb9e637a6f875dcb7c5de7b9df20c4aa7fcc0a4b40e69.webp","width":250,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_23856","characterName":"せんかんるきゅう","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"23856","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"せんかんるきゅう","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"战舰ル级是深海栖舰部队的主力之一，给玩家留下最大印象就是其强大的火力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"玩家第一次接触ル级在游戏初期的1-3图。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23856"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a70a743c159b2e08b83a23ff8aaf186c56606cb9a431a73e6825819c7d977172.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6cb292e874974440024101cca7afcf02aa7201f980428e0c801a7590c7708c72.webp","width":256,"height":251,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_23857","characterName":"北方酱","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"23857","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"北方酱","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/45a61f542cfb3c7699e0798674e48b264b7cbc81cbe37a26c03a0fd90e3ccb56.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7bb2537d743ac656237c48c81284c40689b83ecc23a5b9704d90023a5cce456e.webp","width":256,"height":238,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"金元寿子","creatorId":"vndb:s1769","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1769","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1769","name":"金元 寿子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:23857:5941:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_23858","characterName":"軽巡棲鬼","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"23858","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"軽巡棲鬼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c4af75f6a41b6061d5ba11d0a1f9252fee69cb42cd909a2d8c5a964ca0bbb9d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8ea55f8a07c8d0bd94614f3cd5c2f09e854c514d53ac37d3e73e920ad701db0f.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_23866","characterName":"伊号第401潜水舰","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"23866","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"伊号第401潜水舰","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"122"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"7.02"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"12"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊400型潜水艦二番艦、伊401です。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地球をぐるっと一周以上余裕で航行できる長大な航続力と、特殊攻撃機「晴嵐」を3機搭載する潜水空母なんです。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そう、戦略的秘密兵器…秘密なんだからっ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊号第四〇一潜水舰（日语：伊号第四〇一潜水艦，简称伊401）为第二次世界大战时期大日本帝国海军旗下潜水舰。本舰为伊四〇〇型潜水舰的二号舰。正式名称为“伊号第四百一潜水舰”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本舰于1945年（昭和20年）1月8日竣工，但此时日本战败几乎已经是定局。尽管如此，在终战前的7月20日，仍然为了对美国海军机动部队的泊地乌利西环礁发动进攻而从舞鹤出港，7月23日从大凑出击。第1潜水队司令有泉龙之介大佐以指挥官身份搭乘，舰长由南部伸清少佐担任。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"据航海日志记载，伊401曾遇到一次暴风雨的袭击，原定与僚舰伊号第四〇〇潜水舰在中途会合，但并未达成。原计划同伊号第四〇〇潜水舰在8月17日发动进攻，但在攻击开始之前就迎来终战，在当地收到投降命令。舰内成员在自沉和进攻两种选择中激烈讨论，最终由舰长决定返航。由于舰载机需要进行保密而在海上进行了销毁处置。在返航途中的8月29日被美军在海上接收。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本舰在落入美军手中进行研究和实验后，1946年5月31日在珍珠港附近沉船处分。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23866"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a54065663c70f68d163cc95d38b58cea89c83c5984e88aff15695fc5c8a04dca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9ccb98f6a9df4134a6d0047b26f71cb0f49700531fd7d108e6dc563208204e0a.webp","width":158,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊瀬茉莉也","creatorId":"vndb:s4898","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4898","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4898","name":"伊瀬 茉莉也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:23866:4769:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_28602","characterName":"くちくせいき","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"28602","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"くちくせいき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ヤラセハ…シナイ…ヨ……ッ！」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"驱逐栖姬是游戏《舰队Collection》中，敌舰“深海栖舰”中的一名，舰种为驱逐舰。在2014年11月14日开始的秋季活动E2中作为Boss首次出场，也是自运营以来首次出现的人形深海驱逐舰。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"28602"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abb4c63f5555c6fc5d8c14a316a0f502c2ebf1e242a41be9e69a383b4713e4c2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/017e57d443e8c628fbbcf3b02491cce4cd98fbeeed714d3f4232c5a1ccea9fea.webp","width":193,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小澤亜李","creatorId":"vndb:s7434","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7434","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7434","name":"小澤 亜李","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:28602:15287:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_28603","characterName":"くうぼすいき","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"28603","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"くうぼすいき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ススミタイノ…カ……？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"28603"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb2977026e2e89638df1c1095057f245cbd24d43aa1f831bca8a7dbe94585c5b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/1843abb32d6034e7e6535c790dce3bb89a58340af1c715a4a223eece124ab28c.webp","width":256,"height":224,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小澤亜李","creatorId":"vndb:s7434","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7434","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7434","name":"小澤 亜李","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:28603:15287:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29261","characterName":"如月号驱逐舰","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29261","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"如月号驱逐舰","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"102.72"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"2.92"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"9.16"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"睦月型駆逐艦2番艦の如月と申します。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウェーク島では五月蝿いF4F戦闘機の攻撃を受けながら奮戦しました。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いやん、ほんと、髪の毛が潮風で痛んじゃう……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"如月（きさらぎ）は日本海軍の駆逐艦。睦月型駆逐艦の2番艦である。艦名は旧暦2月のこと。艦名は初代神風型駆逐艦の「如月」に続いて2代目。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1923年度計画艦。舞鶴工作部で建造され、1925年12月21日に竣工、佐世保鎮守府に所属した。当初は「第二十一号駆逐艦」という艦名であり、一等駆逐艦に類別され、1928年8月1日に「如月」と改名された。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1937年からの支那事変により中支、南支方面に進出する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1941年12月8日 太平洋戦争の開戦により、日本軍は中部太平洋方面ではウェーク島とグアムの攻略を開始した。「如月」は第6水雷戦隊第30駆逐隊に所属し、第6水雷戦隊旗艦である軽巡洋艦「夕張」等と共にクェゼリン環礁を出撃しウェーク島攻略に向かった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1941年12月11日 艦隊はウェーク島への艦砲射撃を開始したが、アメリカ軍の反撃は激しく、4時3分には駆逐艦「疾風」が海岸にある砲台からの砲撃により撃沈された。5時37分、「如月」はウェーク島ピーコック岬の南でF4F ワイルドキャット戦闘機の機銃掃射を受け、さらにF4F 戦闘機から投下された100ポンド爆弾1発が命中。魚雷が誘爆し、 艦橋と二番煙突の半分、マストを吹き飛ばし、しばらくすると艦は二つ折れになって、5時42分に爆沈した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1942年1月10日、除籍。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29261"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/29f313adbf1f50b3d0f2e1094d94905cd06916cbe1af8a2e6c43b527d95fb8ab.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/59c5e0a2c0bab4ed4004bd621b7c94fbf3986848e31567d967c4fe557c7d7da4.webp","width":166,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"日高里菜","creatorId":"vndb:s5611","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5611","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5611","name":"日高 里菜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:29261:4962:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29266","characterName":"间宫号补给舰","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29266","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"间宫号补给舰","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"144.78"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"8.43"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18.59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元ネタは帝国海軍に実在した給糧艦「間宮」である。18000人分の食料×3週間分を貯蔵できる冷蔵庫を搭載しており、アイス・饅頭・羊羹などの甘味も製造、保管していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また豆腐・蒟蒻を作る職人も軍属として乗艦しているなど充実しており、前線の将兵たちには好評で、間宮が来る日を楽しみに待っていたと言う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"阿川弘之は著書『軍艦長門の生涯』の中で、「長門が連合艦隊の象徴なら、間宮は連合艦隊のアイドルであった」と書いている。那珂ちゃん…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、間宮アイスは銀座の資生堂パーラーやコロンバンに匹敵する味で士官たちを楽しませ、レンガのように大きい間宮羊羹は虎屋の羊羹よりも兵員たちに好評であったそうな。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"このほかクリーニングも町の店以上のクオリティでやってくれたり、僻地の港で艦隊作業するときには陸路出張してきた将兵の宿泊も可能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"士官室は客船のサロン並みに広く、士官たちのクラス会ですき焼きパーティもできたりと、まさに至れり尽くせりであった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大東亜戦争では補給任務で活躍したものの、1944年12月に米潜水艦「シーライオン」の雷撃により海南島沖に沈没。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「間宮」の沈没は前線の将兵の士気に多大な影響を与えたという。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29266"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc511d864f73c6fb9685bd990f2c1b4ce88e60865ec6482522ec1d5cb830b011.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/578c427ce3dcb5350836511455f9e07852d20d3fe9280ba2ef9c6bae9ddd3d04.webp","width":168,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"堀江由衣","creatorId":"vndb:s46","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s46","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s46","name":"堀江 由衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:29266:3970:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29481","characterName":"天城号航空母舰","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29481","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"天城号航空母舰","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"216.9"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"7.86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"27"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍型航空母艦、その二番艦、天城です。戦時急造計画であるマル急計画により、建造されました。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"空母機動部隊として運用されることは叶いませんでしたが、呉空襲時の対空戦で奮闘しました。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1942年（昭和17年）10月1日三菱重工業長崎造船所にて起工"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1943年（昭和18年）10月15日進水"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1944年（昭和19年）8月10日竣工"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"9月 空母「雲龍」と第1航空戦隊を編成"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1945年（昭和20年）6月10日呉港外の三ツ子島に碇泊。3月19日、7月24日、7月28日に米軍機の空襲を受け損傷（呉軍港空襲）。応急処置の不備により浸水横転、着底。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"10月 除籍"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1947年（昭和22年）7月31日浮揚作業完了。後に解体処分"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29481"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e6f1021d8726966d07b8a3b29f1c729326ee4e98fd730fef8336b6608ebe53c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/108a0537141f7ef4e72fb790cf9248529a28604a4505406d2fb38c839a6672a4.webp","width":209,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"堀江由衣","creatorId":"vndb:s46","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s46","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s46","name":"堀江 由衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:29481:3970:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29482","characterName":"呂500","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29482","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"呂500","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"76.76"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"4.7"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"6.76"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"——U511——"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドイツ海軍のUボート、潜水艦U-511……です。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頑張って、ここまで来ました。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皆と仲良くなれたら…いいなって…ここの文化に馴染めたらいいなって…思います。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"——呂500——"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドイツ海軍のUボート、U-511を日本海軍式に改装して運用した、呂号第500潜水艦です。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞鶴を母港として運用されました。実戦には出なかったんだけど、対潜部隊の訓練などで活躍しました、はい！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1941年12月4日に竣工。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"通商破壊戦に従事し、5隻を撃沈、1隻に損害を与える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1943年5月10日、フリッツ・シュネーヴィント（Fritz Schneewind）艦長の指揮の下、ベルリン駐在日独伊三国同盟の軍事委員である野村直邦海軍中将を乗せ、ドイツ占領下にあるフランスのロリアンを出航。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同年8月7日、呉に入港。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同年9月16日に日本海軍の艦籍に入る。「呂号第五百潜水艦」と命名される。本籍を呉鎮守府とし呉鎮守府警備潜水艦に定められる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実戦には投入されず、対潜訓練隊（後の第五十一戦隊）で訓練目標として使用。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞鶴で終戦を迎える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1945年11月30日除籍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1946年4月30日米軍によって若狭湾で海没処分。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29482"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c457eb39dae33073f7620bf0a44e6dbc8001c1e94d61803b98870c4642dc7596.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/102e1d19b94eef3814032521a727a4de0aed89db4e290c62b7d56997b527c806.webp","width":161,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"茅野愛衣","creatorId":"vndb:s630","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s630","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s630","name":"茅野 愛衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:29482:5847:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29483","characterName":"朝霜号驱逐舰","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"朝霜号驱逐舰","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"119.3"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"3.76"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"10.8"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あたいは夕雲型駆逐艦、その十六番艦、朝霜さ。よーく覚えとくんだよ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦況が悪化した頃にデビューしたんだ。でも、その末期の戦線を、文字通り縦横無尽に駆けまわったぜ。やるだけ…やったさ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朝霜（あさしも）は、日本海軍の駆逐艦。夕雲型の16番艦である。戦艦「大和」の沖縄水上特攻作戦（坊ノ岬沖海戦）に参加し、米艦載機の爆撃を受け撃沈された。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"2015年2月6日，作为2015年冬イベント『迎撃！トラック泊地強襲』的E-2及往后Boss、E-5道中的掉落舰实装。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"2019年10月25日，改二实装。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"2026年5月29日，补强改装实装，改二补不可切换回改二。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29483"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e99caf02bc1ed959c30165c312dc829e6dc0110c6225fcca1e4ba249f7bee96d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76ae5253f300cd23035f234e6f472666dc7239ab953731f74db15cc927ddf784.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"茅野愛衣","creatorId":"vndb:s630","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s630","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s630","name":"茅野 愛衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:29483:5847:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29484","characterName":"香取号练习巡洋舰","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29484","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"香取号练习巡洋舰","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"133.5"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"5.75"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"15.95"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"香取型練習巡洋艦一番艦の香取です。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"はい、練習遠洋航海の指揮は、お任せください。必ずや艦隊の練度向上にお力添えできると思います。え、戦艦との砲撃戦…ですか？それは用兵的にどうなのでしょうか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"香取（かとり）は日本海軍の練習巡洋艦。 香取型練習巡洋艦の1番艦である。艦名は、千葉県の香取神宮に由来している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29484"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/796c1df32797fb9669ad8a31eefde8e6ed6211f9974424642e22ecdf8554254f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0da26bb4eb95fa37d1377222d82a55c509895c1d388fd6a6d05636d05ec9ce4e.webp","width":131,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"茅野愛衣","creatorId":"vndb:s630","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s630","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s630","name":"茅野 愛衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:29484:5847:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29485","characterName":"伊号第八潜水艦","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"伊号第八潜水艦","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"109.3"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"5.26"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"9.1"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"遣独潜水艦作戦の第二次遣独艦として、かの地に向かったのよ。そして、Uボートをもらったの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この作戦は5回行われたんだけど、機雷とか色々あって、無事往復できたのは私だけなんですって…そうね、機雷なんてダイッキライ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊号第八潜水艦（いごうだいはちせんすいかん）は、大日本帝国海軍の潜水艦で伊七型潜水艦（巡潜3型）の2番艦。第二次世界大戦の最中に遣独潜水艦作戦としてドイツと日本を往復したことで知られる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29485"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/91343e7e949803e3b1f97595ecd139e8aef0a7d5b6676ee83f8a228c32be0988.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e9db7923c9d02c1b5bc94884194d146737ec9c572a4db2605046e7d0cf8394b4.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"味里","creatorId":"vndb:s11254","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11254","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11254","name":"味里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84391:29485:10781:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29486","characterName":"伊号第五八潜水艦","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"伊号第五八潜水艦","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"108.7"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"5.19"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"9.3"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"最初からがんばって最後まで戦ったんだよ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"苦しくなってからだって、凄い重巡だって仕留めたし！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"任務を全うして、全てが終わった後、無事に呉の母港に帰ったんだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊号第五八潜水艦は、大日本帝国海軍の潜水艦で、巡潜乙型潜水艦である伊五四型潜水艦の一隻。この名を持つ日本海軍の潜水艦としては2隻目。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29486"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/715ca6e07a63077c0d9e7dcc660a6d25fd5761246d87e922ce53e2123aef6021.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1ba8075bce9d0bcf1f03179ec8143e5648c9b51b5c0616e2d7500166f6250474.webp","width":145,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29487","characterName":"伊号第一六八潜水艦","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"伊号第一六八潜水艦","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"104.7"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"4.58"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"8.2"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれも育ちも呉の潜水艦なの。あのミッドウェーの大海戦のあと、飛龍が最後の力で深手を負わせたヨークタウンに留めを刺したのよ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"空母たちの仇は取ったわ！　あの大変な島への輸送任務でも頑張ったの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊号第一六八潜水艦（いごうだいひゃくろくじゅうはちせんすいかん）は、日本海軍の潜水艦。伊一六八型潜水艦（海大VI型a）の1番艦。竣工時の艦名は伊号第六八潜水艦。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29487"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e9016666a31d68e3d71a56e07921883b15d20ec529e1db3b86e4ee9da38ba3af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/561596a4973aaeb0a08f9e6e8ac2280cbf8e2957c642928c02527baa2f08a828.webp","width":145,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29488","characterName":"丸优","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"84391"}]},"originalCharacterName":"丸优","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"まるゆは海軍工廠出身じゃないので、同郷のお友達がいないんです。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皆さんとちょっと違うっていうか…木曾さんには第一声で「何だお前、潜れるのか？」なんて言われちゃうし…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まるゆ、ここで上手くやっていけるのかなあ…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"潜航輸送艇は、日本陸軍の潜水艦。通称のまるゆ（○の中に「ゆ」と書く）で知られる。1型と2型があり、主に輸送任務で用いられた。陸軍は最終的には400隻以上の建造を計画していたが、終戦までに完成したのは38隻に留まった。正式名称は「潜航輸送艇」であり、制式兵器であることを示す「三式」は付さない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29488"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/ccb8fe65a74eb3bb372673389e2392414ee8aaeb5ef3c176f4637d11b17cb5b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25797772cede06dd33f719c72